{"id": "34903", "title": "奋斗》下", "author": "石康", "category": "文学名著", "count": 66, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34903/34903s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34903.htm", "intro": "一个奋发有为的年轻人。他有两个父亲，于是他发现两条生活道路。他有两个恋人，于是他拥有两种情感。他有一种理想，却导致另一种现实。他有一种最可贵的精神，那就是不停地奋斗。 年轻俊朗的陆涛有才华、有激情。自建筑学院毕业后，他一直希望能够成就一番辉煌的事业，继父陆亚迅却经常提醒他要更多地脚踏实地。陆涛的亲生父亲徐志森携巨款来到北京发展房地产业，陆涛赫然发现自己有了两条不同的生活道路……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34903", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2309525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2309526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2309527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2309528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2309529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2309530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2309531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2309532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2309533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2309534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2309535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2309536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2309537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2309538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2309539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2309540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2309541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2309542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2309543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2309544.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2309545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2309546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2309547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2309548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "23